WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.980
WhatsApp campaigns work the way the team already runs them on InvestWell: a campaign list with its audience, schedule and delivery status.

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:13.105
A new campaign starts with a name. Then the three familiar steps: choose the clients, choose the report, and schedule it.

00:00:13.155 --> 00:00:20.669
Choose the clients: family heads only, opted-out clients excluded automatically, or search by name, relationship manager, PAN or mobile.

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:26.910
Choose the report to send. Only a mapped template can go out; an unmapped one stays greyed until it is approved and mapped.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:32.617
Send now or schedule it, once or monthly, with a preview of the exact message the first client will receive.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:38.440
The campaign joins the list as Scheduled. Delivery and read counts come back from the provider after it goes out.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:46.143
Templates are mapped to the approved WhatsApp template by its API campaign name, with category, format and sample values, exactly as on InvestWell.

